# Task: elementwise_add_plain
Elementwise add plain (benchmarks/elementwise_ckks). Inputs: ciphertext `x0`, plaintext vector `p`. Output: `y` = x0 + p (depth 0).

Correctness: every output must be within 1e-06 (absolute) of the expected values on all test cases (fixed, dense). Timing is measured on the dense case.

# Baseline kernel
```cpp
// Baseline generated by agent/tasks/gen_baselines.py; elementwise add_plain, as in benchmarks/elementwise_ckks.

void fhe()
{
  Ciphertext x0("x0");
  Plaintext p("p");
  Ciphertext y = x0 + p;
  y.set_output("y");
}
```

